{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "clases",
      "title": "Clases disponibles",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"padding:10px;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:15px;\">Todas las clases de Season 6 están habilitadas. Las que tienen nivel de unlock o ticket requieren llegar a ese nivel con alguno de tus personajes primero.</p><table class=\"ranking\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;line-height:1.6;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Clase Base</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Evol. 1 (150)</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Evol. 2 (220)</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Evol. 3 (400)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Dark Wizard</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Soul Master</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Marlon Quest</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Grand Master</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Dark Knight</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Blade Knight</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Combo Quest</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Blade Master</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Fairy Elf</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Muse Elf</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Infinity Arrow</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">High Elf</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Summoner</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Bloody Summoner</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Dimension Master</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Magic Gladiator</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Duel Master</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Quest 400</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Dark Lord</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Lord Emperor</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Quest 400</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Rage Fighter</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">First Master</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Quest 400</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "items-tier",
      "title": "Items tier A-F (drops especiales)",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"padding:10px;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:15px;\">Mientras farmeás, los mobs pueden tirar items consumibles que al usarlos te dan un premio. Aparecen con más frecuencia en zonas de nivel alto. <strong>Drop rate: ~0.5% por kill por tier.</strong></p><table class=\"ranking\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;line-height:1.6;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Tier</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Item</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Mobs Lvl</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Al consumirlo te da</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>A</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Star of Sacred Birth</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">1+</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Sets básicos / armas iniciales +7 (Luck/Opt)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>B</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Firecracker</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">30+</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Sets intermedios / armas tier 2 +7 (Luck/Opt)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>C</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Heart of Love</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">60+</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Sets medios / armas avanzadas +7 (Luck/Opt)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>D</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Olive of Love</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">90+</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">1 jewel al azar</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>E</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Silver Medal</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">120+</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">1 jewel al azar</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>F</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Gold Medal</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">150+</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">1 jewel al azar</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "mapas",
      "title": "Guía de Mapas",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Cada mapa tiene su nivel mínimo de entrada. Los usuarios <strong>VIP</strong> tienen beneficios de acceso temprano.</p><table class=\"ranking\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:30%;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #444;\">Mapa</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"width:15%;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #444;\">Lvl Normal</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"width:15%;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #444;\">Lvl VIP</th><th style=\"width:40%;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #444;\">Notas</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Lorencia / Noria / Elveland</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">10</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Zonas de inicio. NPCs de venta y quests iniciales.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Devias</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">20</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">NPC Priest Sevina (Quest 150).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Dungeon</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">50</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 19-55.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Atlans</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">70</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 43-74.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Lost Tower</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">100</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 47-66.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Tarkan</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">140</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 72-93.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Icarus</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">170</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 75-108.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Arena</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">50</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 72-118.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Aida</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">150</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">-</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Hell Maine (Drop Quest 380).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Kanturu Ruins 1</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">160</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">130</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 80-105.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Kanturu Ruins 2</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">180</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">130</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 80-105.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Kanturu Ruins 3</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">230</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">130</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 80-105.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Kanturu Relics</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">280</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">200</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 117-129.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Karutan 1 & 2</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">200</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">160</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 99-120.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Raklion</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">280</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">240</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 102-148 + Boss Selupan.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Swamp of Calmness</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">350</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">300</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 95-137.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Vulcanus</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">350</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">300</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 90-124.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Land of Trials</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">280</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">250</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 75-102 + Boss Erohim.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Crywolf</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">320</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">300</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 97-118 + NPC Apostle Devin (Quest 380/400).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Barracks of Balgass</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">350</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">300</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mobs lvl 117-119.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><strong>Balgass Refuge</strong></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">350</td><td class=\"num gold-cell\" style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">300</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Dark Elf - Master Quest.</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "id": "alas-n3",
      "title": "Guía Wings Nivel 3",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"padding:10px;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">Fase 1: Feather of Condor</h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Alas Nivel 2 +9+4 (min)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Item Ancient +7+4 (min)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Jewel of Chaos + Creation + Pack 10 Soul</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Éxito max: <strong>60%</strong></li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">Fase 2: Alas Nivel 3</h3><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Feather of Condor + Flame of Condor (Drop mobs lvl 120+)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Item Excellent +9+4 (min)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Jewel of Chaos + Creation + Pack 10 Bless + Pack 10 Soul</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Éxito max: <strong>40%</strong></li></ul></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "sockets",
      "title": "Sistema de Sockets - Seed Sphere",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"padding:10px;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">1. Drop de Seed Spheres</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\">Las esferas ya ensambladas, en todos sus elementos y niveles (1 al 5), se obtienen exclusivamente como botín de los <strong>T9 Bosses</strong>:</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Selupan</strong> (Hatchery - Raklion)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Erohim</strong> (Land of Trials)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Dark Elf</strong> (Refugee)</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">2. Elementos Disponibles</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\">Las Seed Spheres se dividen en categorías orientadas al combate o la supervivencia:</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Ofensivos (Armas):</strong> Fire, Ice, Lightning.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Defensivos (Sets):</strong> Water, Wind, Earth.</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">3. Inserción de Componentes (Assembly)</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\">NPC: <strong>Seed Researcher</strong> (Elveland). Requisitos:</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Ítem Base con Socket Slots vacíos.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">1 Seed Sphere (Elemento/Nivel a elección).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">1 Jewel of Chaos + 1 Jewel of Creation.</li></ul></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "quests",
      "title": "Sistema de Quests",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"padding:10px;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:15px;\">Las quests son fundamentales para desbloquear el potencial de tu personaje. Se dividen por nivel y clase.</p><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">1. Primera Evolución (Lvl 150)</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>NPC:</strong> Sebina the Priestess (Lorencia)</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Fase 1:</strong> Conseguir 1 <em>Scroll of Emperor</em> (Dungeon, Lost Tower).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Fase 2:</strong> Conseguir item de clase: <em>Broken Sword</em> (DK), <em>Tear of Elf</em> (Elf), <em>Soul Shard</em> (DW), <em>Eye of Abyssal</em> (Sum).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Premio:</strong> Evolución de clase (ej: Dark Knight → Blade Knight) y +10 puntos.</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">2. Hero Status / Marlon (Lvl 220)</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>NPC:</strong> Marlon (rota entre Lorencia, Noria, Devias, Atlans)</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Fase 1 (Todas):</strong> Conseguir <em>Ring of Honor</em> (Tarkan).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Fase 2 (Solo BK):</strong> Conseguir <em>Dark Stone</em> (Tarkan).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Premio:</strong> Habilita Combo (BK) e Infinity Arrow (Elf). Da 6 puntos por nivel en lugar de 5.</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">3. Evidence of Strength (Lvl 380)</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>NPC:</strong> Apostle Devin (Crywolf)</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Objetivo:</strong> Conseguir 1 <em>Flame of Death Beam Knight</em>, 1 <em>Horn of Hell Maine</em> y 1 <em>Feather of Dark Phoenix</em>.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Premio:</strong> +20 puntos.</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #444;padding-bottom:5px;\">4. Master Quest (Lvl 400)</h3><p style=\"line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>NPC:</strong> Apostle Devin (Crywolf)</p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Fase 1:</strong> Matar 20 Balram, 20 Death Spirit y 20 Soram en Barracks.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Fase 2:</strong> Matar a la <em>Dark Elf</em> en Refuge.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\"><strong>Premio:</strong> Tercera evolución (ej: Blade Master) y acceso al Master Skill Tree (ventana 'A').</li></ul></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comandos",
      "title": "Comandos útiles",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"padding:10px;\"><table class=\"ranking\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;line-height:1.6;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:40%;padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Comando</th><th style=\"width:60%;padding:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #444;color:#fff;\">Qué hace</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/addstr</code> <code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/addagi</code> <code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/addvit</code> <code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/addene</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Suma N puntos al stat correspondiente.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/reset</code> · <code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/resetinfo</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Resetear y consultar estado de resets.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/post</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Mensaje global para todo el servidor.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/pkclear</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Limpiar PK status. Costo: 100k Zen × cantidad de muertes.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/ware</code> · <code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/clearinv</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Abrir baúl remoto o vaciar inventario.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/move</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Teletransportar a un mapa específico.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/offlevel</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Dejar el personaje leveleando desconectado (Solo VIP).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/re auto</code> · <code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/re off</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Manejo automático de invitaciones a Party.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\"><code style=\"background:#1a1a1a;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;\">/vipinfo</code></td><td style=\"padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;\">Consulta el tiempo restante de tu suscripción VIP.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    }
  ]
}
